P4Fbgjth4mrQ64dry6xM8r3","id":"ctco_01a07c4d-f6a9-7d50-a5dc-8b9db0dba487","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791879.337643,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nEntire's CLI is the source of truth for its own usage. Do not guess flags or\nsubcommands — read them from this command. You are already inside the repo:\nentire auto-detects it from the git origin remote, so never ask the user for the\nrepo name. Pass --repo only to target a DIFFERENT repo.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nWhen to use entire — the commands that bear on the work:\n  checkpoint  Inspect and search checkpoints\n                task-driven\n  search      Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n                read-only\n  session     Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n                read-only except: adopt, attach, resume, stop\n  status      Show Entire status\n                read-only\n  why         Show why a line exists\n                read-only\n\nAlso available (entire agent-help \u003ccommand\u003e for any of these):\n  read-only, safe to run:\n    activity · labs · recap · version\n  when the task needs them:\n    api · dispatch · doctor\n  the user's — suggest, don't run:\n    agent · auth · clean · configure · disable · enable · grant\n    login · logout · org · plugin · project · repo\n\nDrill in for exact, currently-installed flags:  entire agent-help \u003ccommand\u003e  (e.g. entire agent-help checkpoint)\nAdd --json for structured output.\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"call_id":"call_fC3R6H9XRO87YvukUvFnIeiF","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecc497d1487d2acbf2cc20be59c67","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire agent-help session | sed -n '1,300p'\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:16000});text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791879.970851,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_fC3R6H9XRO87YvukUvFnIeiF","id":"ctco_01a07c4e-0719-77e1-a8e6-0767f314e623","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791883.545869,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nentire session — Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\nView and manage agent sessions tracked by Entire.\n\nCommands:\n  list     List all sessions across all worktrees\n  info     Show detailed information for a specific session\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\n  stop     Stop one or more active sessions\n  current  Show the active session for the current worktree\n  attach   Attach an existing agent session\n  adopt    Adopt an active session from another worktree\n  resume   Switch to a branch and resume its session\n\nExamples:\n  entire session list                      List all sessions\n  entire session info \u003csession-id\u003e         Show session details\n  entire session info \u003csession-id\u003e --json  Output as JSON\n  entire session tokens \u003csession-id\u003e       Show token usage\n  entire session stop                      Interactive stop\n  entire session current                   Active session for cwd\n  entire session attach \u003csession-id\u003e       Attach an external session\n  entire session adopt \u003csession-id\u003e --from ../repo  Adopt a moved session\n  entire session resume \u003cbranch\u003e           Resume from a branch\n\nCurrent repo: gh/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nInherited flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nSubcommands: adopt · attach · current · info · list · resume · stop · tokens\n             read-only except: adopt, attach, resume, stop\nNext:  entire agent-help session \u003csubcommand\u003e\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"call_id":"call_WEFmpjBaxhIDu22foIIpVDZr","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecc4d69d487d2b0d8bb07241cee89","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire agent-help session attach | sed -n '1,260p'\\nentire session current --json || true\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:16000});text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791884.442011,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_WEFmpjBaxhIDu22foIIpVDZr","id":"ctco_01a07c4e-1944-7b71-81e9-f8dce3a13cc7","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791888.196959,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nentire session attach — Attach an existing agent session\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nFlags:\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \"claude-code\")\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\n\nInherited flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990\",\n  \"agent\": \"Codex\",\n  \"status\": \"ended\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-09-06T21:43:02.411744+02:00\",\n  \"last_active\": \"2026-09-06T21:43:02.411744+02:00\",\n  \"turns\": 134,\n  \"checkpoints\": 0,\n  \"last_checkpoint_id\": \"01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\",\n  \"tokens\": {\n    \"total\": 1720546631,\n    \"input\": 38603701,\n    \"cache_read\": 1678768128,\n    \"cache_write\": 0,\n    \"output\": 3174802\n  },\n  \"last_prompt\": \"Arbeite im Repo /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app autonom weiter.\\n\\nZiel: Testcenter-Rewrite als lauffähige, produktionsnahe Anwendung mit möglichst hoher Parität zum ursprünglichen Testcenter fertigstellen.\\n\\nLies zuerst docs/PARITY.md, README.md, git status und die letzten 15 Commits.\\nSetze anschließend immer den nächsten sinnvollsten Implementierungsschritt um.\\n\\nAktueller nächster Kandidat:\\nPrüfe und implementiere den teilnehmerisolierten Review-CSV-Download auf der Participant-Starterseite entsprechend dem Original-Ablauf „Reviews downloaden“. Review-Erfassung und Admin-Export existieren bereits.\\n\\nBewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.\\nCommitte sinnvolle abgeschlossene Schritte. Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.\\nFrage nicht nach „weiter?“.\"\n}\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecc52b17c87d292f062254094bc71","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"Die Korrektur baut jetzt sauber und der temporäre Test-Bypass ist entfernt. Ich verknüpfe den abgeschlossenen Commit nun mit derselben Entire-Session; dadurch erhält der Commit den Checkpoint-Trailer und wird anschließend zusammen mit den Checkpoint-Refs zu GitHub gepusht.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecc53414087d29c8f12d798e3b922","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1788791889.591448,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_g3a238r78X1jjJtGDPoVFWcm","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecc55901887d28d961f9c0323aa9a","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"entire session attach 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990 --agent codex --force \u0026\u0026 git log -1 --format=fuller \u0026\u0026 git status --short \u0026\u0026 git push origin testcenter-rewrite-parity \u0026\u0026 git rev-parse HEAD \u0026\u0026 git ls-remote origin refs/heads/testcenter-rewrite-parity 'refs/entire/checkpoints/*' | tail -n 12\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:20000});text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791889.591448,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_g3a238r78X1jjJtGDPoVFWcm","id":"ctco_01a07c4e-4fe2-7c42-95d7-3099891a24de","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788791902.178845,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.1 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\nSession 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990 already has checkpoint 01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\n\nLast commit: f16f09e Match review code notice dismissal\nAmended commit f16f09e with Entire-Checkpoint: 01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\ncommit ede527171121744cbb05693f31bdf265cee2ecc0\nAuthor:     jurei733 \u003c67505990+jurei733@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\nAuthorDate: Mon Sep 7 16:37:49 2026 +0200\nCommit:     jurei733 \u003c67505990+jurei733@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\nCommitDate: Mon Sep 7 16:38:18 2026 +0200\n\n    Match review code notice dismissal\n    \n    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\n?? docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx\nTo https://github.com/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite.git\n   d374fb1..ede5271  testcenter-rewrite-parity -\u003e testcenter-rewrite-parity\nede527171121744cbb05693f31bdf265cee2ecc0\ncc78ecba3b5b4ff69a5d9b10669bc630db840e3c\trefs/entire/checkpoints/3E/01M17MBK5MJ164DHNDD9Y0B73E\n572fde5f946abc190f81119a3dd0f7d7c897298e\trefs/entire/checkpoints/9Y/01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\nede527171121744cbb05693f31bdf265cee2ecc0\trefs/heads/testcenter-rewrite-parity\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"content":null,