bei **94 % ±3 Prozentpunkten**.\n\nDie ungetrackte PPTX blieb unverändert; SHA-256 weiterhin `7a2826bc8f1a9ffb92519a90f3784a6b1dbc27000892b21068a55a637a958a8a`.\n\n\u003coai-mem-citation\u003e\n\u003ccitation_entries\u003e\nMEMORY.md:2101-2140|note=[Repo workflow, review CSV history, and preserved PPTX constraint]\n\u003c/citation_entries\u003e\n\u003crollout_ids\u003e\n019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990\n\u003c/rollout_ids\u003e\n\u003c/oai-mem-citation\u003e","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecd1cc08887d2b4bec1c5fec2bf87","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1788792086.28113,"turn_id":"01a07c3c-380a-7f42-8196-eaae0bc18892"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":null,"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecd2ce24c87d2b82459a195ba3319","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07c51-6e4c-7433-8863-f41dc16b814b"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"Der vorige Schritt war echter Fortschritt: Upstream-Anforderung, Implementierung, Commit und Push sind erfolgt. Ich prüfe jetzt zuerst die beiden laufenden CI-Gates bis zum belastbaren Endzustand; danach behebe ich gegebenenfalls Fehler oder nehme den nächsten offenen Paritätspunkt aus der aktuellen Queue.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecd2ecfd087d29544290ef7becc77","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1788792107.797723,"turn_id":"01a07c51-6e4c-7433-8863-f41dc16b814b"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_fbCwMBiBGIw8OvZggS2FpcA9","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9ecd312fdc87d2a834ae1874bbd38e","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n -C 2 'Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV|testcenter-thread-migration-process' /Users/julian/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -n 60\\ngit status --short\\ngit rev-parse HEAD\\ngit branch --show-current\\ngit remote -v\\nshasum -a 256 docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx\\ngh run list --branch testcenter-rewrite-parity --limit 4 --json databaseId,event,headSha,status,conclusion,url,createdAt | jq '.'\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:12000});text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788792107.797723,"turn_id":"01a07c51-6e4c-7433-8863-f41dc16b814b"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_fbCwMBiBGIw8OvZggS2FpcA9","id":"ctco_01a07c51-abe6-7a80-a18c-1f855656bdfe","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788792122.34259,"turn_id":"01a07c51-6e4c-7433-8863-f41dc16b814b"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.4 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n2099-- Label 5G web-test data as a standardized stress test, not guaranteed daily runtime; distinguish hardware specifications, test photos, and AI-generated extreme zoom. [Task 3]\n2100-\n2101:# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV parity and CI verification\n2102-\n2103-scope: Implement and verify original-compatible participant-scoped Review CSV export while preserving unrelated files and the user's no-push boundary.\n--\n2138-\n2139-- “autonom weiter” / “Frage nicht nach ‘weiter?’” -\u003e execute the next bounded parity task autonomously. [Task 1]\n2140:- “Bewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.” -\u003e hash-check it before/after work and never stage it. “Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.” means local commits only until explicit push authorization; the rollout violated that boundary, so treat it as a hard stop rule. [Task 1]\n2141-- “Prüfe konkret die thread ...” -\u003e inspect real thread metadata, goals, activity, cwd, and unresolved work before advice. [Task 2]\n2