\n  09-06 21:43 (8220675) Verify replacement chain rollback lineage\n\n● 01M17MBK5MJ164DHNDD9Y0B73E  \"Arbeite im Repo /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rew...\"\n  09-04 07:39 (9d994a9) Allow slow cold compose installs to finish\n  09-04 07:15 (2c4ba61) Allow cold compose builds to finish\n  09-04 05:59 (a45f843) Keep deleted replacements out of live lineage\n  09-03 21:18 (19e1b26) Keep replacement histories linear\n  08-30 23:26 (d43c8f7) Guard source deletion against dependency races\n  08-30 22:00 (d362626) Reject stale workspace dependency selections\n  08-30 20:46 (bb178d1) Gate current adaptive browser restrictions\n  08-30 19:46 (dd8fb76) Observe Verona answers before persistence checks\n  08-30 19:27 (cc4bf30) Stabilize large STARS recovery polling\n  08-30 19:10 (330c24c) Gate adaptive runtime restriction composition\n  08-30 17:40 (0092802) Gate nested runtime policy precedence\n  08-30 16:33 (88b65c8) Support IBM500 XML intake\n  08-30 15:48 (4844ca5) Split long browser verification shards\n  08-30 14:46 (bf7c575) Allow browser shards to finish\n  08-30 14:11 (9f8f4a9) Reload monitor data after route mocks\n  08-30 13:46 (a55ceab) Use interactive IB runtime readiness\n  08-30 13:16 (9a5a9c0) Preserve player focus through debounce\n  08-30 12:41 (e192966) Contain routed workspace views\n  08-30 11:42 (15cf551) Prevent activity feed from blocking controls\n  08-30 11:08 (e5c6582) Stabilize roster copy browser interaction\n  08-30 10:46 (a9e6123) Contain activity feed layouts\n  08-30 10:05 (409b9d6) Stabilize confirmation and IB browser readiness\n  08-30 09:46 (9b792e5) Gate IB player compatibility in CI\n  08-30 09:43 (e0c90af) Enable interactive IB runtime compatibility\n  08-30 09:43 (d9bf737) Stabilize route-derived application shell state\n  08-30 08:47 (9d7613b) Accept registered Latin XML aliases\n  08-30 08:32 (a688c51) Render record collections as blocks\n  08-30 08:09 (2f22ea5) Contain record collection layouts\n  08-30 07:48 (46bf587) Sele