{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:10:05.648Z","ordinal":59725,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07e90-ac50-7612-bb28-b558ebb77f29","call_id":"call_jotoYGKPnZmRiNkOwcJdPXlh","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"d8d9f5\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.0343335,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1367,\"output\":\"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\\n\\n# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV parity and CI verification\\n\\nscope: Implement and verify original-compatible participant-scoped Review CSV export while preserving unrelated files and the user's no-push boundary.\\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app; reuse_rule=reuse within this checkout; fixture bytes/commits/CI are snapshot-specific.\\n\\n## Task 1: Implement the participant-scoped “Reviews downloaden” CSV export\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-12T22-27-40-eh2w-participant_review_csv_download_and_ci_verification.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/13/rollout-2026-08-13T00-27-40-019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-03T20:17:35+00:00, thread_id=019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, success; CI run 33795680908 passed all 34 jobs on attempt 2)\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-07-30T17-58-32-ssaB-testcenter_rewrite_parity_investigation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-07-30/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code-2, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T19-58-32-019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:27:33+00:00, thread_id=019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551, reconnaissance only)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- participant-review-export, GET /reviews/export, Reviews downloaden, ReviewController::getAllReviewsFromPersonExport, ReviewDAO::getReviewsByPerson, ReviewCSVFormatter, testcenter-reviews.csv, Keine Kommentare verfügbar., category_*, 33795680908\\n\\n## Task 2: Smoke stabilization pushed but final CI not captured\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/12/rollout-2026-08-12T18-22-05-019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:25:22+00:00, thread_id=019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6, partial; cwd redirects to rewrite-app)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- smoke-ui.mjs, networkidle, domcontentloaded, #participantRouteEntry, dispatchEvent, b7e772e, 31646851924\\n\\n## Task 3: Testcenter-Rewrite goal paused by usage guard\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-23T20-55-05-bKDg-codex_usage_watcher_testcenter_rewrite.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/23/rollout-2026-08-23T22-55-06-01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-23T22:40:57+00:00, thread_id=01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2, success; current goal-state handoff)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- Testcenter-Rewrite, Implement participant review CSV, 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, goalStatus paused, 68% consumed, 32% remaining, usage guard\\n\\n## User preferences\\n\\n- “autonom weiter” / “Frage nicht nach ‘weiter?’” -> execute the next bounded parity task autonomously. [Task 1]\\n- “Bewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.” -> hash-check it before/after work and never stage it. “Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.” means local commits only until explicit push authorization; the rollout violated that boundary, so treat it as a hard stop rule. [Task 1]\\n- “Prüfe konkret die thread ...” -> inspect real thread metadata, goals, activity, cwd, and unresolved work before advice. [Task 2]\\n\\n rewrite-app/README.md                   |  4 ++++\\n rewrite-app/package.json                |  2 +-\\n rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-ib-player.mjs | 21 +++++++++++++++++++--\\n 3 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\\n\\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\\n\\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\\n\\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\\n\\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\\n\\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \\\"claude-code\\\")\\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\\n  -h, --help             help for attach\\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07e8e-9d5c-73c1-bd49-1bd09bbfbe0c","create_time":1788829805.648616}}}
