testcenter_rewrite_parity_investigation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-07-30/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code-2, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T19-58-32-019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:27:33+00:00, thread_id=019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551, reconnaissance only)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- participant-review-export, GET /reviews/export, Reviews downloaden, ReviewController::getAllReviewsFromPersonExport, ReviewDAO::getReviewsByPerson, ReviewCSVFormatter, testcenter-reviews.csv, Keine Kommentare verfügbar., 634189c5, 34142852366\\n\\n## Task 2: Smoke stabilization pushed but final CI not captured\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/12/rollout-2026-08-12T18-22-05-019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:25:22+00:00, thread_id=019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6, partial; cwd redirects to rewrite-app)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- smoke-ui.mjs, networkidle, domcontentloaded, #participantRouteEntry, dispatchEvent, b7e772e, 31646851924\\n\\n## Task 3: Testcenter-Rewrite goal paused by usage guard\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-23T20-55-05-bKDg-codex_usage_watcher_testcenter_rewrite.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/23/rollout-2026-08-23T22-55-06-01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-23T22:40:57+00:00, thread_id=01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2, success; historical goal-state handoff)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- Testcenter-Rewrite, Implement participant review CSV, 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, goalStatus paused, 68% consumed, 32% remaining, usage guard\\n\\n## Task 4: Start the GPT-6 continuation thread for 100% parity\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-12T22-27-40-eh2w-testcenter_rewrite_gpt6_handoff_and_review_export.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/13/rollout-2026-08-13T00-27-40-019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-07T17:49:01+00:00, thread_id=019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, success; autonomous continuation handoff)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- 01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a, Testcenter Rewrite auf 100 Prozent, GPT-6 Astra, npm run start:local, http://127.0.0.1:4310/app, Entire, 01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y, P0, Verona\\n\\n## User preferences\\n\\n- “autonom weiter” / “Frage nicht nach ‘weiter?’” -> execute the next bounded parity task autonomously. [Task 1][Task 4]\\n- “Bewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.” -> hash-check it before/after work and never stage it. “Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.” means local commits only until explicit push authorization; the rollout violated that boundary, so treat it as a hard stop rule. [Task 1]\\n- “Prüfe konkret die thread ...” -> inspect real thread metadata, goals, activity, cwd, and unresolved work before advice. [Task 2]\\n\\n## Reusable knowledge\\n\\n- Original `GET /reviews/export` derives the person from the auth token and calls `ReviewDAO::getReviewsByPerson($personId)`; it returns CSV by default (JSON when requested) and HTTP 204 for no comments. UI wording is `Reviews downloaden`, `Keine Kommentare verfügbar.`, and `testcenter-reviews.csv`. Implement a dedicated server-authorized participant endpoint, not a workspace-filtered admin export; preserve test-run plus participant-session isolation. Local `npm run test:unit:built` passed 129 tests; CI run `34142852366`, attempt 2, passed 34/34 jobs. [Task 1]\\n- Target Original files directly: `frontend/src/app/app-root/starter/starter.component.html`/`.ts`, `backend/src/controller/ReviewController.class.php`, `backend/src/dao/ReviewDAO.class.php`, `backend/src/helper/ReviewCSVFormatter.php`, `backend/routes.php`, and E2E `e2e/src/e2e/Test-Controller/review.cy.ts`. Rewrite paths are participant UI `apps/web/src/app/participant-view.component.ts`/`.facade.ts`, contracts/application/API, and `docs/PARITY.md`. [Task 1]\\n- Participant runtime uses `domcontentloaded` plus semantic waits, not `networkidle`; wait for `#participantRouteEntry` detached. `dispatchEvent('click')` is a suitable smoke workaround for overlay-obstructed controls when testing application event handling. [Task 2]\\n- The historical usage-guard pause is superseded as a continuation route by thread `01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a`, `Testcenter Rewrite auf 100 Prozent`. Start with reproducible `npm run start:local` demo flow, then P0 original-package/dependency corpus, adaptive runtime policy, and Verona-player gaps, then P1/P2; claim 100% only after evidence-backed P0/P1 closure and green CI. [Task 3][Task 4]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07ead-8e91-7751-b50d-4a0964b41175","create_time":1788831704.39442}}}
