{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:46:38.787Z","ordinal":60323,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f77002cf3a055dd016a9f68fc6a6887d295ed37dddfb9aad0","status":"completed","call_id":"call_sdeh9qpnAL1nrKZBuB2sr4aq","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n same run ID.\\n+\\n+Participant end-button correction: the saving-mode `Complete Test` action now\\n+uses that same Starter-return transition instead of the separate, irreversible\\n+complete API. This matches the upstream `lock_test_on_termination` OFF case:\\n+the same run and responses remain available through `Weiter`; ON still applies\\n+the authored lock. Explicit API/operator final completion remains final. The\\n+browser regression checks draft persistence, unchanged run ID, and re-entry;\\n+the Original BookletConfig OFF/ON expectations distinguish resume from locking.\\n+The local MaP Aspect tryout additionally verified end, resume, and reload with\\n+the existing response unchanged. This does not imply full acceptance of its ZIP.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"tail -12 /tmp/testcenter-resume-api-check.log; git diff --check; git diff --stat; git status --short; df -h .\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",\"max_output_tokens\":650}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07eae-ce7e-73e0-b41d-bd3b7820d090","create_time":1788831990.840347}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:46:38.801Z","ordinal":60324,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a07eae-ce7e-73e0-b41d-bd3b7820d090","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-9dd33b95-95ca-44bd-98ee-1ae2f742920d","changes":{"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -1234,2 +1234,12 @@\n \n+Participant end-button correction: the saving-mode `Complete Test` action now\n+uses that same Starter-return transition instead of the separate, irreversible\n+complete API. This matches the upstream `lock_test_on_termination` OFF case:\n+the same run and responses remain available through `Weiter`; ON still applies\n+the authored lock. Explicit API/operator final completion remains final. The\n+browser regression checks draft persistence, unchanged run ID, and re-entry;\n+the Original BookletConfig OFF/ON expectations distinguish resume from locking.\n+The local MaP Aspect tryout additionally verified end, resume, and reload with\n+the existing response unchanged. This does not imply full acceptance of its ZIP.\n+\n ### Import and content administration\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\n"},"completed_at_ms":1788831998801}}
