nsnahe Anwendung mit möglichst hoher Parität zum ursprünglichen Testcenter fertigstellen.\\\\n\\\\nLies zuerst docs/PARITY.md, README.md, git status und die letzten 15 Commits.\\\\nSetze anschließend immer den nächsten sinnvollsten Implementierungsschritt um.\\\\n\\\\nAktueller nächster Kandidat:\\\\nPrüfe und implementiere den teilnehmerisolierten Review-CSV-Download auf der Participant-Starterseite entsprechend dem Original-Ablauf „Reviews downloaden“. Review-Erfassung und Admin-Export existieren bereits.\\\\n\\\\nBewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.\\\\nCommitte sinnvolle abgeschlossene Schritte. Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.\\\\nFrage nicht nach „weiter?“.\\\"\\n── Sessions ────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n\\nCodex · (unknown) · session 01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a · checkpoint 01M1Z92Z1Y7FKE5ZH6JXY2YMNE\\n> \\\"Arbeite im Repo /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rew...\\\"\\nended · started 1h ago · tokens 1839275.7k\\n\\nCodex · (unknown) · session 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990 · checkpoint 01M1W3X3RVDCK2XC818BZY6R9Y\\n> \\\"Arbeite im Repo /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rew...\\\"\\nended · started 1d ago · tokens 1720546.6k\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n2 sessions\\n\\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\\n\\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\\n\\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\\n\\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\\n\\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\\n\\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \\\"claude-code\\\")\\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\\n  -h, --help             help for attach\\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n{\\n  \\\"hooks\\\": {\\n    \\\"PostToolUse\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex post-tool-use'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"SessionEnd\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex session-end'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 3\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"SessionStart\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then printf \\\\\\\"%s\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"systemMessage\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Entire CLI is enabled but not installed or not on PATH. Installation guide: https://docs.entire.io/cli/installation#installation-methods\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"; exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex session-start'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"Stop\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex stop'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"SubagentStart\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex subagent-start'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"SubagentStop\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex subagent-stop'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"UserPromptSubmit\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"matcher\\\": null,\\n        \\\"hooks\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"command\\\",\\n            \\\"command\\\": \\\"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks codex user-prompt-submit'\\\",\\n            \\\"timeout\\\": 30\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n#!/bin/sh\\n# Entire CLI hooks\\n# Post-commit hook: condense session data if commit has Entire-Checkpoint trailer\\nif [ -x '/opt/homebrew/Caskroom/entire/0.10.3/entire' ]; then '/opt/homebrew/Caskroom/entire/0.10.3/entire' hooks git post-commit 2>/dev/null || true; else :; fi\\ntotal 208\\n-rw-------@ 1 julian  staff  105330 Sep  8 04:34 entire.log\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07edd-0865-7870-abf3-ba67d94695c7","create_time":1788834840.578204}}}
