ed using the fonts or their derivatives.\nL24: DEFINITIONS\nL25: \"Font Software\" refers to the set of files released by the Copyright\nL26: Holder(s) under this license and clearly marked as such. This may\nL27: include source files, build scripts and documentation.\nL28: \nL29: \"Reserved Font Name\" refers to any names specified as such after the\nL30: copyright statement(s).\nL31: \nL32: \"Original Version\" refers to the collection of Font Software components as\nL33: distributed by the Copyright Holder(s).\nL34: \"Modified Version\" refers to any derivative made by adding to, deleting,\nL35: or substituting -- in part or in whole -- any of the components of the\nL36: Original Version, by changing formats or by porting the Font Software to a\nL37: new environment.\nL38: \nL39: \"Author\" refers to any designer, engineer, programmer, technical\nL40: writer or other person who contributed to the Font Software.\nL41: PERMISSION & CONDITIONS\nL42: Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining\nL43: a copy of the Font Software, to use, study, copy, merge, embed, modify,\nL44: redistribute, and sell modified and unmodified copies of the Font\nL45: Software, subject to the following conditions:\nL46: \nL47: 1) Neither the Font Software nor any of its individual components,\nL48: in Original or Modified Versions, may be sold by itself.\nL49: 2) Original or Modified Versions of the Font Software may be bundled,\nL50: redistributed and/or sold with any software, provided that each copy\nL51: contains the above copyright notice and this license. These can be\nL52: included either as stand-alone text files, human-readable headers or\nL53: in the appropriate machine-readable metadata fields within text or\nL54: binary files as long as those fields can be easily viewed by the user.\nL55: 3) No Modified Version of the Font Software may use the Reserved Font\nL56: Name(s) unless explicit written permission is granted by the corresponding\nL57: Copyrigh